      "text": "Reranker request (shared API):\nPOST {MIMIR_RERANKER_URL}/v2.0/sites/{sitekey}/recommend\n?version=\u2026&platform=semantic_search&campaignId=\u2026\ncount default 100 (DEFAULT_RECOMMENDATION_COUNT)\nClient: mimir/internal/downstream/reranker/encode_decode.go",
