      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deployment load quirk (Go):\nFor platform=semantic_search, config handler is aragorn#recommend\n(NOT semantic_search#recommend) \u2014 reranker/internal/recommend/service.go\n\nDecision (semantic_search.go):\nIF model_metadata AragornEnabled (enabled=true)\n  \u2192 aragorn.VectorSearch\n  \u2192 POST {ARAGORN_HOST}/v1/{store}/collections/{id}/search\nELSE\n  \u2192 optional query embedding\n  \u2192 aipipeline.GetInference \u2192 KServe ISVC predict\n  \u2192 http://{algo}-{inferenceId}-{suffix}.{ns}/v1/models/{deployment}/versions/{ver}:predict",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deployment load quirk (Go):\nFor platform=semantic_search, config handler is aragorn#recommend\n(NOT semantic_search#recommend) \u2014 reranker/internal/recommend/service.go\n\nDecision (semantic_search.go):\nIF model_metadata AragornEnabled (enabled=true)\n  \u2192 aragorn.VectorSearch\n  \u2192 POST {ARAGORN_HOST}/v1/{store}/collections/{id}/search\nELSE\n  \u2192 optional query embedding\n  \u2192 aipipeline.GetInference \u2192 KServe ISVC predict\n  \u2192 http://{algo}-{inferenceId}-{suffix}.{ns}/v1/models/{deployment}/versions/{ver}:predict",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
