      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cron / GitOps:\n\u2022 cerebro.yaml cluster workflows\n\u2022 reranker.yaml env per region\n\u2022 Flux team-ai services\n\nSpin new ISVC:\nName hash from site+model+deployment_id\nSTORAGE_URI from train S3\nNamespace PIPELINES_IFSVC_NAMESPACE",
