      "originalText": "Defaults cheat sheet:\nReranker fetch count = 100\nHybrid Solr patch = 10 products\nCerebro max_predictions = 100\nAragorn RRF default limit = 100\n\nHandlers: image_search, pdp force semantic off (enablement.md \u00a78)",
